# 2 rooftop laundry and fish
"Cinematic photorealistic scene, the sky became the ocean, and the city got used to it." + SKY + " On an old apartment rooftop in a dense city neighborhood, an elderly woman in a cardigan and slippers is hanging her laundry on a line, as she does every morning. The white sheets and shirts on the line float and sway upward like seaweed in the water above. A school of small silver fish swirls around her laundry, nibbling at a shirt, and a sea turtle glides lazily past just above the clothesline. Without looking up, the woman shoos the fish away with a broom in one hand, clothespins in her mouth, completely annoyed and unsurprised, like chasing pigeons. On the next rooftop, a man waters his potted plants while a small octopus clings to his water tank. Soft green-blue light rays from above, white laundry, terracotta pots, silver fish, warm cardigan colors. Eye-level medium shot on the rooftop, 50mm lens, ARRI Alexa, Kodak Vision3 250D, subtle grain, shallow depth of field, the precise moment frozen. Important visual details: the ocean sky above, the laundry floating upward like seaweed, the fish nibbling the laundry, the turtle, the annoyed grandmother with her broom. Dreamy, surreal, cinematic, a little funny.",
# 3 kids flying fish like kites
"Cinematic photorealistic scene, the sky became the ocean, and the city got used to it." + SKY + " In a green city park on a sunny Sunday afternoon, children are flying kites, but instead of kites they each hold a long fishing line attached to a real living fish swimming in the sky-ocean above them: a bright orange clownfish, a big flat stingray gliding like a kite, a pufferfish puffed up like a balloon, a little striped fish darting sideways. A small girl in a yellow dress runs across the grass, laughing, pulling her stingray along, its long tail streaming behind it. On the benches, parents sit reading and eating ice cream, not looking up at all; one father helps his son untangle his line from a passing jellyfish. Soft blue-green light rays falling onto the bright green grass, colorful fish, children's colorful clothes, warm sunlight. Eye-level medium-wide shot from the grass, 50mm lens, ARRI Alexa, Kodak Vision3 250D, subtle grain, the precise moment frozen with the girl in mid-stride. Important visual details: the ocean sky above the park, the children holding lines attached to real fish flying like kites, the running girl with her stingray, the relaxed parents. Dreamy, surreal, cinematic, joyful.",
# 4 rooftop pool, shark lifeguard
"Cinematic photorealistic scene, the sky became the ocean, and the city got used to it." + SKY + " A fancy hotel rooftop pool party on a skyscraper on a bright summer day. People in summer clothes and sunglasses lounge on deck chairs with cocktails, music playing. High on a white lifeguard chair at the edge of the roof, a lifeguard in a red T-shirt watches the sky-ocean above through binoculars, a whistle in her mouth, and holds up a red shark warning flag, because a large real grey shark is circling slowly in the water directly above the party, its fin and white belly clearly visible. The partygoers glance up for one second and calmly go back to their drinks; one man simply opens a big beach umbrella over his head. Bright sunlight filtered through blue-green water, turquoise pool, white deck chairs, red flag, grey shark. Eye-level medium-wide shot on the rooftop, 50mm lens, ARRI Alexa, Kodak Vision3 250D, subtle grain, the precise moment frozen. Important visual details: the ocean sky above the rooftop, the shark circling right above the party, the lifeguard with binoculars and the red warning flag, the unbothered partygoers. No text on the flag. Dreamy, surreal, cinematic, a little funny.",
# 5 window washers scraping barnacles
"Cinematic photorealistic scene, the sky became the ocean, and the city got used to it." + SKY + " High up on the glass facade of a modern skyscraper, two window washers in grey overalls, harnesses and hard hats stand on a hanging gondola, scraping thick crusts of real barnacles, mussels and green seaweed off the windows with long metal scrapers, the way they used to wipe off dust. A curious octopus clings to the glass beside them and a small school of yellow fish drifts past their heads; one washer pushes a fish aside with the back of his hand like a fly, without even looking. Inside the office behind the glass, a businessman at his desk keeps typing on his laptop, not looking up. Far below, the city streets are visible, and above them all, the ocean surface glitters. Blue-green underwater light rays, glass reflections, grey overalls, white barnacles, green seaweed, yellow fish. Eye-level medium shot level with the gondola, 85mm lens, ARRI Alexa, Kodak Vision3 250D, subtle grain, the precise moment frozen. Important visual details: the ocean sky, the barnacles and seaweed growing on the skyscraper windows, the two washers scraping them, the octopus and fish, the office worker inside. Dreamy, surreal, cinematic, a little funny.",
